&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1VYBsBHEMY/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;./static/image/武大模拟演示封面.png&#34; alt=&#34;MiroFish Demo Video&#34; width=&#34;75%&#34;/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
